/*!
    \qmltype AccountProviderPickerDialog
    \inherits Dialog
    \ingroup sailfish-accounts

    \brief A dialog containing a list of selectable account providers

    The AccountProviderPickerDialog type provides a dialog page which allows selection
    of account providers.  The dialog may only be accepted if the user has selected
    at least one provider; otherwise, the user may only reject the dialog.
*/

/*!
    \qmlproperty int AccountProviderPickerDialog::providerCount

    This property contains the number of providers in the ProviderModel
*/

/*!
    \qmlsignal AccountProviderPickerDialog::providerSelected(int index, string providerName)

    This signal is emitted by the list view when the user
    selects an account provider.  The \a index is the index into
    the ProviderModel corresponding to the account provider selected
    by the user, and the \a providerName is the name of the provider.
*/

/*!
    \qmlsignal AccountProviderPickerDialog::providerDeselected(int index, string providerName)

    This signal is emitted by the list view when the user
    deselects an account provider.  The \a index is the index into
    the ProviderModel corresponding to the account provider deselected
    by the user, and the \a providerName is the name of the provider.
*/